sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant W as Worker
  participant D as PostgreSQL
  participant T as Target host
  W->>D: Claim job + host
  D-->>W: Job + ownership
  W->>D: Record attempt
  W->>T: SSH fixed JBPA action
  activate T
  Note over W,T: SSH execution may take minutes.<br/>No API call waits for completion.
  T-->>W: Structured outcome and evidence
  deactivate T
  W->>D: Store result + event
  W->>D: Release ownership
  Note over W,T: Transport loss requires reconciliation.<br/>Keep host ownership until resolved.
